# AI Translated
msgid "Entering Texture displacement painting"
msgstr "Įjungiamas tekstūrinio reljefo piešimas"

# AI Translated
msgid "Leaving Texture displacement painting"
msgstr "Išjungiamas tekstūrinio reljefo piešimas"

# AI Translated
msgid "Texture displacement editing"
msgstr "Tekstūrinio reljefo redagavimas"

# AI Translated
msgid "Choose SLA archive:"
msgstr "Pasirinkite SLA archyvą:"

# AI Translated
msgid "SL1 / SL1S archive files"
msgstr "SL1 / SL1S archyvo failai"

# AI Translated
msgid "Import file"
msgstr "Importuoti failą"

# AI Translated
msgid "Import model and profile"
msgstr "Importuoti modelį ir profilį"

# AI Translated
msgid "Import profile only"
msgstr "Importuoti tik profilį"

# AI Translated
msgid "Import model only"
msgstr "Importuoti tik modelį"

# AI Translated
msgid "Accurate"
msgstr "Tikslus"

# AI Translated
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Subalansuotas"

# AI Translated
msgid "Quick"
msgstr "Greitas"

# AI Translated
msgid "Baking texture displacement"
msgstr "Įkepamas tekstūrinis reljefas"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The bake produced no displacement, so nothing was changed and the paint was "
"kept. Check that the painted layer has a texture and a non-zero depth."
msgstr ""
"Įkepimas nesukūrė jokio reljefo, todėl niekas nepakeista, o piešinys "
"išsaugotas. Patikrinkite, ar nupieštas sluoksnis turi tekstūrą ir nenulinį "
"gylį."

# AI Translated
#, boost-format
msgid ""
"The triangle budget limited the detail: this resolution needs %1% triangles, "
"the budget kept %2%. Raise Budget or use a coarser Resolution for the full "
"detail."
